#
# Perturbs OfflineAudioContext s sample rate by a seed-derived value in +/-0.01 Hz, which changes
# every rendered sample and therefore the readback hash. Gated on --fingerprint=<seed>: with no
# seed getSampleRateNoise returns 0 and nothing moves. --disable-spoofing=audio opts out.
#
# getNoiseData() is defined and never called -- dead in the 144 original too. Kept verbatim rather
# than trimmed so the port stays a faithful copy; it is a non-static namespace-scope function, so
# it draws no -Wunused-function.
#
# The live AudioContext is untouched: audio.sampleRate and maxChannelCount must not move, only
# audio.render.*.

